The release notice must identify the Steward, the project and covered release, the applicable licence version, a functioning licensing contact and the location of source and third-party notices. It must not claim ownership of Contributions the Steward does not own.

Notices under this License must be in a form that can be retained and must identify the sender, the relevant rights or authority, the software and the matter concerned. Contractual notices may be sent to an address designated for them or another address valid under applicable law. This clause does not replace formal service requirements for legal proceedings.

